  "description": "WPF spreadsheet control built for 10M-row business datasets (.NET 8/9/10/11+ Windows, AnyCPU), verified by a continuous 24-hour 6-worker soak test (1.94B ops, 5.98M assertions, 0 anomalies, 0 crashes, ~300 FPS steady on 1M-row scroll, 459K lifecycle churns with 0 GDI/heap leak). Viewport DrawingVisual rendering, star-sizing columns, zero-overhead cell widgets (Button/ComboBox/Apple DatePicker/CheckBox/ToggleSwitch/ProgressBar/Image) + viewport-virtualized arbitrary WPF DataTemplate column, cancelable CellsMerging hook, auto-themed ContextMenu, fluent 2D/computed cell merges, multilevel headers, frozen columns, 5M-row live CRUD & undo, ColumnarSheetTable, and LRU paging. 官方完整开源演示项目：https://github.com/hu-xiao-tian/LightExcel.StandardWpf | 问题反馈/联系邮箱: 2285161881@qq.com",
